+PASS: runtime H4 cleanup scratch at .s3qd RVA 0x2F31F0 remains eight zero bytes on disk.
+PASS: helper fits entirely in the pre-existing zero executable cave 0x2F109A..0x2F114A; no section growth/header edit.
