+Exact Stage 3V guarded patches
+------------------------------
+0x0597FB: B9 06 00 00 00 -> B9 04 00 00 00
+  H4 installed camera-core obtains an owning FROM_ADDRESS loader reference.
+0x059A9A: original logger call -> Stage3V log+release helper
+0x059AA8: original logger call -> same log+release helper
+  Untransferred HMODULE is released on create/handle failure.
+0x059A3F: generation clear -> helper replay + post-MinHook FreeLibrary
+  Enable failure releases only after disable/remove/state clear.
+0x07CA57: generation load/xor -> jump to capture helper
+  Successful teardown captures retained HMODULE before existing state clear.
+0x07CB6F: final logger call -> logger+release helper
+  Successful teardown drops loader ownership only after hooks/state are gone.
+0x030894: TitleAdapter_GetActiveTitle call -> wrapper that preserves AL and opportunistically invokes existing exact-byte H4 effect installer.
+0x2EF73E: ineffective selected-effect scale=0 -> call helper writing matrix translation.z = +10000.0f.
